                <tr style="height:17.65pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:middle;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:80%; font-size:7.5pt;"><strong>Odada bulunan tuvalet, lavabo, banyo, yatak ve varsa televizyon, radyo, wifi (havalimanı işletmecisinin sağladığı kadar) imkanlarından &uuml;cretsiz olarak faydalanabilirsiniz.</strong></p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="height:8pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:90%; font-size:7.5pt;">You can use the toilet, sink, shower, bed, and, if available, television, radio, WiFi as provided by the airport operator) in the room, free of charge.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="height:17pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:middle; background-color:#d9d9d9;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:80%; font-size:7.5pt;"><strong>Yakınlarınıza bilgi vermek veya başka g&ouml;r&uuml;şmeler yapmak i&ccedil;in misafirhane girişinde bulunan uluslararası ve şehirlerarası g&ouml;r&uuml;şmelerde a&ccedil;ık olan ve kredi kartı veya telefon kartı ile &ccedil;alışan ankes&ouml;rl&uuml; telefonları kullanabilirsiniz.</strong></p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="height:17pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; border-bottom-style:solid; border-bottom-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top; background-color:#d9d9d9;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:80%; font-size:7.5pt;">To inform your relatives or to make other calls, you can make use of the payphones located at the guesthouse entrance, which are equipped for international and long-distance calls and accept credit cards or phone cards.</p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="height:17pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; border-top-style:solid; border-top-width:0.75pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:middle;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:80%; font-size:7.5pt;"><strong>Havalimanında kaldığınız s&uuml;re boyunca size yardım ve refakat etmek &uuml;zere havalimanı &ouml;zel g&uuml;venlik şirketinden bir g&ouml;revli yanınızda bulunacak. Herhangi bir ihtiyacınız olursa bu g&uuml;venlik g&ouml;revlisinden yardım isteyebilirsiniz.</strong></p>
                    </td>
                </tr>
                <tr style="height:17pt;">
                    <td style="width:488.6pt; padding-right:5.03pt; padding-left:5.03pt; vertical-align:top;">
                        <p style="margin-top:0pt; margin-bottom:0pt; text-align:justify; line-height:80%; font-size:7.5pt;">During your stay at the airport, an officer from the airport&apos;s private security company will assist and accompany you. You may ask this security guard for assistance if you need anything.</p>
                    </td>
